      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2021-november/q1",
      "question": "<p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_1=3\\left(\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)+\\mathrm i\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_2=\\sqrt2\\left(\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)-\\mathrm i\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>write down the exact value of<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|z_1z_2\\right|\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arg(z_1z_2)\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol></li></ol><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=z_1z_2\"></span> and that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arg(w^n)=0\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z^+\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>determine<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>the smallest positive value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\"></span></li><li>the corresponding value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|w^n\\right|\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol></li></ol>",
