    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2021-november/q3",
      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=\\arcsin x\\qquad -1\\leqslant x\\leqslant 1\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Determine the first two non-zero terms, in ascending powers of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>, of the Maclaurin series for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\"></span>, giving each coefficient in its simplest form. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li><li>Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\dfrac12\"></span> into the answer to part (a) and hence find an approximate value for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\pi\"></span><br>Give your answer in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{p}{q}\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> are integers to be determined. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
